  "description": "The perfect kids bike for your little BMXers. A premium quality kid’s bike, designed with our cool, BMX style. Featuring rear coaster brakes, to ensure safe stopping. Where will your little one explore first?\nFun and super easy to ride, the Explorer S 16″ is perfect for kids aged 4 – 8 years. The durable steel frame and BMX style handlebars means that kids can easily control the Explorer S 16″ for safe and fun riding.\nThe full-length chainguard means little hands are protected from mess. The junior specific saddle and grips means kids ride comfortably and easily. With detachable training wheels, the Explorer S 16″ is ready to inspire confidence in your child’s riding level.",
